# Web Conventions

- App Router; server components by default, `"use client"` only when needed
- Call ReBind API via `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`; no direct TCGdex calls
- Tailwind for styling; card slots use aspect ratio ~2.5:3.5
- Show plan limits in UI (e.g. "1/1 binders") but always rely on API enforcement
